<mxCell id="rule" value="&lt;b&gt;order.#&lt;/b&gt; grows with your key schema: add a 4th word tomorrow and it still matches.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;order.paid.*&lt;/b&gt; is a length contract: exactly 3 words, or nothing. Add a word and every * binding goes silent.&lt;br&gt;Special cases: &lt;b&gt;#&lt;/b&gt; alone = fanout.&amp;nbsp; A pattern with no wildcard (order.paid.eu) = direct." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;rounded=1;spacingLeft=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="430" width="1080" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
